The scripts under bitnami/scripts are Bitnami's, from
https://github.com/bitnami/containers at commit
e9581664a2cee4295bac7abefb84a50f785fdcc6 (2026-09-02, the last release of
bitnami/minio-client, 2025.8.13-debian-12-r29), directory
bitnami/minio-client/2025/debian-12: prebuildfs/opt/bitnami/scripts and
rootfs/opt/bitnami/scripts.

Copyright Broadcom, Inc. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, in
bitnami/LICENSE.

Two files are changed: libbitnami.sh prints a welcome line that names this
image instead of Bitnami's, and libminioclient.sh hands mc the secret key on
stdin instead of as an argument, where every user on the host could read it.
tests/vendored-scripts.sh checks that each differs by exactly its
tests/<name>.diff and that every other file is byte for byte what that commit
holds.
